<h2 id="custom-notes-speed">custom notes speed</h2>
<div class="boxe">

<p>the most minial notes speed is <code>0.35</code> ( really really slow ), i strongly not recommended to exceed this speed </p>
<blockquote>
<p>risk to break notes scroll</p>
</blockquote>
</div>

<h2 id="characters-fmc">characters/.FMC</h2>
<div class="boxe">

<p>a <strong>.FMC</strong> is the characters data where the animation/delay/scale even scripts are in ( just like <strong>characters.json</strong> if you know <strong>Pysch engine</strong> )</p>
<p>composition :</p>
<pre><code class="lang-json">  <span class="hljs-string">"alt name"</span><span class="hljs-symbol">:<span class="hljs-string">"boyfriend"</span></span>,  <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span> character alt name
  <span class="hljs-string">"icon"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"bf"</span>,  <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span> icon folder
  <span class="hljs-string">"position"</span>: [<span class="hljs-number">0</span>,<span class="hljs-number">0</span>],   <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span> character position ( <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> w.i.p )
  <span class="hljs-string">"scale"</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1.3</span>,    <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span> scale
  <span class="hljs-string">"flipX ?"</span>: <span class="hljs-keyword">false</span>,    <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span> flip the position
  <span class="hljs-string">"Padding Length ?"</span><span class="hljs-symbol">:true</span>,  <span class="hljs-regexp">//</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">use</span> a xml frame naming animation <span class="hljs-keyword">or</span> a default one-
  <span class="hljs-regexp">//exemple</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"anim0.png &gt;&gt; anim19.png"</span> xml : <span class="hljs-string">"anim0000.png &gt;&gt; anim0019.png"</span>
</code></pre>

</div>
<h2 id="easing">easing</h2>
<div class="boxe">

<p><strong>linear :</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>linear  </li>
<li>linear(0, 0.25, 1)</li>
<li>linear(0, 0.25 75%, 1)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>ease :</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>ease                  </li>
<li>ease-in               </li>
<li>ease-out              </li>
<li><p>ease-in-out           </p>
</li>
<li><p>cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.1, 0.25, 1)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>step :</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>step-start            </li>
<li><p>step-end             </p>
</li>
<li><p>steps(4, end)</p>
</li>
<li>steps(10, jump-both)</li>
</ul>
<p>more value <a href="https://andrewraycode.github.io/easing-utils/gh-pages/">here !</a></p>

</div>
<h2 id="makelocalanim">makeLocalAnim</h2>
<div class="boxe">

<p>for making custom anim in start with this simple scripts :] :
work same with <strong>lua</strong></p>
<pre><code class="lang-js">makeLocalAnim(<span class="hljs-string">"mySprite"</span>,game.modsFolder +<span class="hljs-string">"/images/myAnimation,10,0,0,1,"</span>GAME<span class="hljs-string">",100,true,0,0, false, false)</span>
</code></pre>
<p>working like that :</p>
<pre><code><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-title">makeLocalAnim</span><span class="hljs-params">(id, src, length, x, y, scale, putIn, speed, isloop, xdelay, ydelay, flip, paddingLength, otherCss)</span></span>
</code></pre><ul>
<li>for <code>putIn</code> : <br>
you can put your element in: <strong>GAME</strong> , <strong>GUI</strong> or element with a id like :<pre><code class="lang-HTML">&lt;<span class="hljs-keyword">div</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">id</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"hi"</span>&gt;&lt;/<span class="hljs-keyword">div</span>&gt;
</code></pre>
</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
<li>for <code>paddingLength</code> : <br>
if is <code>true</code> your anim work like : <code>myAnim0000.png &gt; myAnim0018.png</code>  <br>
if <code>false</code> your anim work like <code>myAnim0.png &gt; myAnim18.png</code></li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<ul>
<li>for <code>otherCss</code> : <br>
for add addicional CSS, do that :<pre><code class="lang-CSS"><span class="hljs-built_in">background</span>-Color: <span class="hljs-built_in">red</span>; transfrom: <span class="hljs-built_in">rotate</span>(<span class="hljs-number">20</span>deg);
</code></pre>
</li>
</ul>
<pre><code class="lang-js"><span class="hljs-comment">// you can use this for that    ex: "ease"</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// rotate the game</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> myEase = <span class="hljs-string">"ease-in"</span>;
<span class="hljs-keyword">var</span> myAnimation = FMS_makeCSSanim(<span class="hljs-string">"GAME"</span>,<span class="hljs-number">1</span>,myEase,<span class="hljs-string">"1"</span>,[
  { transform: <span class="hljs-string">'rotate(95deg)'</span> }
])
myAnimation.play();
myAnimation.onfinish = <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span>{}
</code></pre>

</div>
<h2 id="fms-playanim">FMS-playAnim</h2>
<div class="boxe">

<p><code>FMS_playAnim()</code> can be used for play custom characters (dad, gf, bf) anim</p>
<pre><code class="lang-js">FMS_playAnim(<span class="hljs-name">characterName=</span><span class="hljs-string">"string"</span>,animName=<span class="hljs-string">"string"</span>,isLooping=<span class="hljs-string">"boolean"</span>)<span class="hljs-comment">;</span>
</code></pre>
<p>exemple : </p>
<pre><code class="lang-js"><span class="hljs-comment">// play *player* *cheer* animation without looping it</span>
FMS_playAnim(<span class="hljs-string">"bf"</span>,<span class="hljs-string">"cheer"</span>,<span class="hljs-literal">false</span>);
</code></pre>
<p>avansed exemple : </p>
<pre><code class="lang-js"><span class="hljs-comment">// play in loop *opponent* *sad* animation every time the player do a good notes hit</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">onNotesHit</span><span class="hljs-params">(longNotes)</span> </span>{
  FMS_playAnim(<span class="hljs-string">"dad"</span>,<span class="hljs-string">"sad"</span>,<span class="hljs-literal">true</span>);
}
</code></pre>
<pre><code class="lang-lua"><span class="hljs-comment">-- in jlua</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">onNotesHit</span><span class="hljs-params">(longNotes)</span></span>
  FMS_playAnim(<span class="hljs-string">"dad"</span>,<span class="hljs-string">"sad"</span>,<span class="hljs-keyword">true</span>);
<span class="hljs-keyword">end</span>
</code></pre>

</div>
